---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Heading from "../../components/Heading.astro";
import LargeButtonCol from "../../components/LargeButtonCol.astro";

const title = "About";

const contactMethods = [
  {
    title: "luke.jones.2567@gmail.com",
    desc: "E-mail",
    link: "mailto:luke.jones.2567@gmail.com"
  }
];
---
<Base title={title}>
  <p>My name is Luke Jones. I'm a student at Aberystwyth University, 
  studying for a BSc in Computer Science with an Integrated Year in 
  Industry.</p> 

  <p>I am currently on said industry year, doing a placement in Bath, 
  England.</p>

  <p>Outside of my degree I spend a fair amount of time playing around with 
  slightly-more gimmicky computers, as well some photography when I can 
  manage. I also have a pretty heavy interest in the history of British Road 
  infrastructure, though that's less relevant to my career aspirations...</p> 

  <Heading level={2}>Contact</Heading> 
  <p>Right now I'd prefer e-mail as the first point-of-contact, but I'll open 
    up more methods in the future. I ask that this is used for serious 
    communications only. Anything else will be respectfully ignored.</p>

  <LargeButtonCol entries={contactMethods} />

  <span class="italic text-gray-500">Last Updated August 2026</span>
</Base>
